    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24272" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δευτερ-όω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>do the second time: repeat,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Si.</u>
					7.14
				</span></i>
			,al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>change,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁδόν</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Je.</u>
				2.36
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τινί</span>
			<i>to give</i> one <i>a second blow,</i> ib. <i><span class="en">
				<u>1 Ki.</u>
				26.8
			</span></i>: c.acc., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινά</span>
			<i>slay,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				<u>3 Ki.</u>
				21(20).20
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> intr.,
				<i>occur twice,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Ge.</u>
				41.32
			</span></i>.</div>
